.git
.wt-*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
# The Backstage frontend app (yarn workspaces, node_modules, build output) is excluded from
# every root-context build -- estate-mcp.Dockerfile, estate-scheduler.Dockerfile and
# fleetview-backend.Dockerfile all build from repo root but none of them need the frontend app.
# fleetview-backend.Dockerfile DOES need backstage/plugins/fleetview-backend/src (its COPY
# source), so that one path is carved back out. A bare `backstage` exclusion here silently
# dropped it from the context before COPY ever ran -- "not found", not a permission error
# (root-caused after fleetview-backend.Dockerfile's build broke on both linux/amd64 and
# linux/arm64: PR idp#3518).
backstage/*
!backstage/plugins
backstage/plugins/*
!backstage/plugins/fleetview-backend
docs/evidence
